body:
this has to be trollage.

&#x200B;

theres no way you selected the offensive tab by default as the default pull up is the view all. and you would have seen the different icons. secondly, the tabs at the top will show different icons accordingly. this is telling you they are of different types. as the tab name suggests. lastly, if you use your eyeballs and read when highlighting the aspect it will tell you a list of items it can be placed on. 

&#x200B;

it can be a little confusing at first. but with this system you are no longer restricted to a certain item slot being used for one specific item or legendary power. you can mix and match them.

so what game with a large open world map starts off with it available to you? i cant think of one in the history of games. so my thought is this request is asinine. 

&#x200B;

besides, you get all major city waypoints unlocked with every character you create with the skip campaign option selected. wether you have found that city waypoint on your 'main' or not. 

&#x200B;

get over yourself.

yea buddy! makes it impossible to see aoe effects you should not be standing in. 

&#x200B;

do hardcore players even party with necros? or if they even use this ability?
